note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Host verification reference: separate f64 accumulation and magnitude to fit six native slots.
fn aracc w view uchar * sc view ushort * x view f32 * to ulong
s = f64 0
for i ulong 4294967296
if ge i mul div len x 128 128
break
end
p = f64 bitcast f32 refb uint get w i
p = mul p f64 get x i
p = mul p f64 bitcast f32 shl uint get sc div i 128 16
s = add s p
end
ret bitcast ulong s
end
